    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Vanessa Botelho Tavares",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102365797555558246167/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVUzBUOsG-Cv4NMmwfHp7QIN3kgUbUpUhG0iHdX8dMKx7PbRHg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "My son has been coming here since he was 3 months old and both of us adore this physio clinic! Welcoming, warm, professional staff whose passion is truly felt to help moms and their children. We recently started the mother-baby swimming classes and we are having a blast! Amazing way to introduce your baby to the water all whilst exercising together and rehabilitating your body after pregnancy. Couldn’t recommend this place enough!",
        "time": 1686264182,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Christina Torino",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109439952076244304684/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK4pcsjwBMHRxSSBetz20lwMI13HzS83PgCO1fzyfNnfAf5bQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Doing mom & baby physio swim for the second time in a row (and I’ll be doing the same class again and again) because I absolutely love it. My baby loves it. Genevieve is SO kind and so very knowledgeable. These classes are my absolute favourite place to be and the highlight of my week.",
        "time": 1684444371,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Danielle Vaillancourt",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108366574731433996082/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVok2gOCdpWA7Hbx11efjb7H8QXLWwDFAyNsoktuF5J1b96UJWH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "First off, the reason I am giving this 3 stars is because the team is knowledgeable and extremely kind. Sadly, the organization and communication is quite poor. I have been waiting to receive the exercises by email from the physiotherapist and she has not communicated them to me after sending 3 emails. I gave up. I was 8 weeks postpartum, I had my consult for my postpartum evaluation (online due to the pandemic) and it was so-so. It is not the best situation nor worth the price when you're the one evaluating yourself for a diastasis recti (ab separation) and the strength of your pelvic floor. Ive seen businesses and health professionals really step it up during the pandemic because their clientele really means the world to them, sadly I feel like I fell through the cracks. If you are reading this, I recommend this place, just make sure you feel you get what you pay for and that they follow up with you.",
        "time": 1593450002,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Serena Hopkins",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118432588050464946299/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJQknB_vUkzPjYz4oQ3w5s1ZxCw5mG4NEe9y6W1DmDbK_gT8A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Great place to get baby used to water! The teachers are great, and the owner is super nice and accommodating!!!",
        "time": 1743523140,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "vanessa beauchamp",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115783751893764662575/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdzEv4Z87E9HMpu35f9Odtr5ZqvyVNl4YGpZWo2aWPNE6T7BZY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 weeks ago",
        "text": "I've been going to this clinic for two years now for my prenatal and postpartum checkups. I've also participated in several of their workshops, both with and without my baby. I have nothing but positive things to say about them. They are empathetic, knowledgeable, passionate, and very generous. I highly recommend this clinic. 😊",
        "time": 1768850664,
        "translated": true
      }
